   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hanging in there.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My fifteen year old wants to start drinking coffee like her friends. Should I let her?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "block": "coffee.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Many health guidelines say small amounts are okay for teenagers, but recommend limiting caffeine. The bigger concern is usually sleep.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She already stays up way too late.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 3.02,
   "block": "coffee.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then the timing matters most. A small coffee in the morning is very different from an iced coffee after school.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Those sweet frappe drinks are",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "coffee.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "what she really wants.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.78,
   "block": "coffee.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Those are often more sugar than coffee, so they're more of a dessert. Maybe agree they're an occasional treat, not a daily thing.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That feels like a fair deal.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "block": "coffee.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It sounds reasonable. Letting her try it with some ground rules usually works better than a total ban.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg20"
  }
